00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Title card: "The Horse and the Infant."

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A man stands in the dark, lit by a small fire.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Soldiers gather in a dim hall. A man holds arrows.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Crowds sleep at long tables at night.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Soldiers huddle together, looking worried.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A man holds up a torch and sings.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
A horse's head under the moon.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Soldiers talk by torchlight.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
A huge horse stands still.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
A man's face, serious.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The horse sits on wheels in front of city walls.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.000
At sunset, a soldier holds a spear and shield.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Two soldiers guard a gate.